{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12114270","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12114270","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1211427001:0":{"text":"行了行了，我看你挺机灵的，应该不会傻到相信自己的笨蛋队友吧？","source_cn":"行了行了，我看你挺机灵的，应该不会傻到相信自己的笨蛋队友吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07326FDEA2C9CC27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1211427002:0":{"text":"他们已经被干掉了，被干掉之前还顺手把你卖了。","source_cn":"他们已经被干掉了，被干掉之前还顺手把你卖了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69EBE810F71C8203","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1211427003:1":{"text":"你要是不想落个同样的下场，就乖乖听话。","source_cn":"你要是不想落个同样的下场，就乖乖听话。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3736C407B66FF1DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1211427004:1":{"text":"你们想问什么……","source_cn":"你们想问什么……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2627F73F5C293112","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1211427005:1":{"text":"你的好队友说，你能打开那些特殊的门。","source_cn":"你的好队友说，你能打开那些特殊的门。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8736816D342A4696","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1211427006:0":{"text":"呵呵呵……不错，我可以。","source_cn":"呵呵呵……不错，我可以。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26D6F248B2B45EB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1211427007:0":{"text":"但是你们刚才突然闯过来攻击我，我一哆嗦，钥匙掉进坩埚里了，这会儿估计已经化成了铁水。","source_cn":"但是你们刚才突然闯过来攻击我，我一哆嗦，钥匙掉进坩埚里...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C22CEB0C6769CD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1211427008:0":{"text":"钥匙不可能只有一把，赶紧把备用钥匙交出来！","source_cn":"钥匙不可能只有一把，赶紧把备用钥匙交出来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x972F23793D023649","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1211427009:1":{"text":"备用钥匙当然有，只不过，在船长手里。恐怕你们得去找他要了。","source_cn":"备用钥匙当然有，只不过，在船长手里。恐怕你们得去找他要了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F65B22354548A78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1211427010:0":{"text":"我看 你是欠揍——","source_cn":"我看 你是欠揍——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68B6F02644902728","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1211427011:0":{"text":"冷静，辛巴达！剩下的交给梅林吧！","source_cn":"冷静，辛巴达！剩下的交给梅林吧！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9148D1793E4BEDB7","varian